{"version":1,"content":"<p>根據日本氣象廳測定，日本小笠原群島附近海域於日本時間早上11時10分發生7級地震，震央位於北緯28.0度、東經139.9度小笠原群島西海岸附近， 震源深度470公里。</p><p>（日本氣象廳／東森新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:07.835005+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T02:29:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:06.208573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798150+00:00","content_hash":"29a246b474a6dd444b905e6fc9b9c03995e50b48eed9f1c06bebfb7eba65fd54","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}